# Public .gitignore for Safari Assistant (2026-09-27, renamed 2026-10-04). NOTE: git has no inline comments - a "#" after a pattern
# becomes part of the pattern. Every comment below sits on its own line.
# Belt and braces only: the release is built by allowlist copy + tools/privacy_gate.py.

# ── Large generated / downloaded artefacts ───────────────────
*.mbtiles
*.pmtiles
*.zim
*.osm.pbf
*.jar
fonts/
data/sources/
data/tmp/
data/tile_weights.tsv.gz
# Regenerated at runtime / not redistributable (AA terms: complete + current only)
data/warnzonen.geojson
data/verwaltungsgebiete.geojson
icon.iconset/
*.icns

# ── Personal content — never commit ──────────────────────────
A_docs/
Wiki/
rag-store.json
rag-store.json.*
*backup*.json
# server.py stores uploaded documents in docs/<module>/ ; only docs/*.md, docs/img/, the GitHub Pages page docs/index.html
# and docs/.nojekyll (empty; Pages then serves docs/ as it is instead of rendering docs/*.md as extra pages) are tracked
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!docs/img/
!docs/index.html
!docs/.nojekyll
# docs/img/ includes the app logo and icon (docs/img/logo/) and docs/img/social-preview.png.
# GitHub Pages videos (rendered by ffmpeg, checked by the privacy gate): exactly these names, nothing else in
# docs/video/: safari-assistant-promo-<xx> (30 s, vertical) and safari-assistant-desktop-<xx> (60 s, landscape),
# <xx> = two lower-case letters. The folder must be re-included before files in it can be; the .mp4 lines follow
# "*.mp4" further down.
!docs/video/
docs/video/*
!docs/video/safari-assistant-promo-[a-z][a-z]-poster.jpg
!docs/video/safari-assistant-promo-[a-z][a-z]-poster.png
!docs/video/safari-assistant-desktop-[a-z][a-z]-poster.jpg
!docs/video/safari-assistant-desktop-[a-z][a-z]-poster.png
# iOverlander and other track/waypoint exports (licence + location history)
*.gpx
*.kml
*.kmz
*.fit
*.tcx
# Office documents, PDFs, mail, contacts, calendars
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.odt
*.pages
*.numbers
*.eml
*.vcf
*.ics
# Private notes and working files of the author
TODO.md
BUGLOG.md
REVIEW-BERICHT*
GITHUB-ANLEITUNG*
MIGRATION_CLAUDE_CODE*
OLLAMA-UPDATE-ANLEITUNG*
*projektstand*
*Projektdokumentation*
_backup*/
_to_delete/
_ollama-test/
ollama-test.sh
ollama-test-bild.png
build-app-intel.sh
# the author's working copy of the icon, top level only (docs/img/logo/ must stay trackable)
/safari-assistant-icon.png
fauna-gbif-matrix.csv
# AI-assistant memory/settings - contain personal context
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
.mcp.json
.cursor/
.aider*
# Editor / merge backups
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
# Privacy-gate term list (keep it OUTSIDE the repo; this is only a safety net)
.privacy-denylist*
*denylist*
tools/private-terms.txt
# deploy.sh auto-commit marker (maintainer's private working folder only)
.deploy-commit

# ── Secrets / keys / certificates ────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
*.csr
*.srl
secrets.json
.safari-assistant-*

# ── Archives, media, databases, logs ─────────────────────────
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.dmg
*.heic
*.mov
*.mp4
# only exceptions: the two Pages videos (see docs/ above); must come after "*.mp4", the last matching line wins
!docs/video/safari-assistant-promo-[a-z][a-z].mp4
!docs/video/safari-assistant-desktop-[a-z][a-z].mp4
*.sqlite
*.db
*.har
*.log

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*.app/
build/
dist/

# ── Python / Node ────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.Python
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
